msgid ""
"Participatory Budgeting (PB) is a democratic process where community members\n"
"    directly decide how to spend part of a public budget. The goal of Participatory\n"
"    Budgeting in Boston is to empower residents to elevate community centered\n"
"    project ideas with an emphasis on social and racial equity."
msgstr ""
"Bidjè patisipatif (PB) se yon pwosesis demokratik kote manm kominote a\n"
" dirèkteman deside kijan pou depanse yon pati nan yon bidjè piblik. Objektif Patisipasyon\n"
" Bidjè nan Boston se bay rezidan yo pouvwa pou yo elve kominote santre\n"
" ide pwojè ak yon anfaz sou ekite sosyal ak rasyal."

#: src/flavors/cycle1/templates/prelaunch.html:117
#: src/flavors/cycle2/templates/prelaunch.html:117
#: src/flavors/cycle3/templates/prelaunch.html:114
msgid ""
"By engaging in Participatory Budgeting, Bostonians of all ages and\n"
"    backgrounds can help inform priorities and future investments for the\n"
"    City’s larger budget process. "
msgstr ""
"Lè yo angaje nan Bidjè Patisipatif, Bostonyen tout laj ak\n"
" orijin yo ka ede enfòme priyorite ak envestisman nan lavni pou la\n"
" Pi gwo pwosesis bidjè vil la. "

