"href=\"https://participate.boston.gov/page/about\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Eksplore soumèt lide 2026 yo.</a>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:1
msgid ""
"<strong>No plain text storage:</strong> We will never store your phone "
"number in plain text. We only store an encrypted hashed version of your "
"phone number to uniquely identify voters."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Pa gen estokaj tèks senp:</strong> Nou p&#39;ap janm estoke nimewo "
"telefòn ou an tèks senp. Nou sèlman estoke yon vèsyon chifre ak hach nimewo "
"telefòn ou an pou idantifye votè yo yon fason inik."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:2
msgid ""
"<strong>No third-party marketing:</strong> We will not share, sell, rent, or"
" trade your phone number or mobile messaging data with third parties or "
"affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Pa gen maketing ak twazyèm pati:</strong> Nou p ap pataje, vann, "
"lwe, oswa fè echanj nimewo telefòn ou oswa done mesaj mobil ou ak twazyèm "
"pati oswa afilye pou rezon maketing oswa pwomosyonèl."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:3
msgid ""
"<strong>One-time verification code:</strong> We send you a single "
"verification code by text message so you can vote. We will not send any "
"further text message communication."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Kòd verifikasyon yon sèl fwa:</strong> Nou voye yon sèl kòd "
"verifikasyon ba ou pa mesaj tèks pou ou ka vote. Nou p ap voye okenn lòt "
"kominikasyon pa mesaj tèks."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:4
msgid ""
"After you vote, you can complete a short demographic survey. This survey is "
"completely optional."
msgstr ""
"Apre ou fin vote, ou ka ranpli yon ti sondaj demografik. Sondaj sa a se yon "
"opsyon."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:5
msgid "Ballot Choices"
msgstr "Chwa Bilten Vòt"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:6
msgid "Demographic Survey"
msgstr "Sondaj Demografik"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:7
msgid "Email Addresses"
msgstr "Adrès Imèl"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:8
msgid ""
"If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact Boston's "
"Office of Participatory Budgeting by email at pb@boston.gov. <a "
"href=\"mailto:pb@boston.gov\">Send us an email.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Si ou gen kesyon sou règleman sou enfòmasyon prive sa a, tanpri kontakte "
"Biwo Bidjè Patisipatif Boston an pa imèl nan pb@boston.gov. <a "
"href=\"mailto:pb@boston.gov\">Voye yon imèl ban nou.</a>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:9
msgid ""
"If you share your email address with us, we only share it with Boston's "
"Office of Participatory Budgeting for mailing list purposes. <a "
"href=\"https://www.boston.gov/departments/participatory-budgeting\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn about the Office of "
"Participatory Budgeting.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Si ou pataje adrès imel ou avèk nou, nou sèlman pataje l avèk Biwo Bidjè "
"Patisipatif Boston an pou rezon lis adrès. <a "
"href=\"https://www.boston.gov/departments/participatory-budgeting\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Aprann plis bagay sou Biwo "
"Bidjè Patisipatif la.</a>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:10
msgid "Phone Numbers and Text Messages"
msgstr "Nimewo Telefòn ak Mesaj Tèks"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:11
#: src/sa_vote/templates/sa_vote/base.html:87
msgid "Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Règleman sou enfòmasyon prive"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:12
msgid "Questions and Contact"
msgstr "Kesyon ak Kontak"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:13
msgid ""
"Ready to vote? <a href=\"/vote/ballot\" data-internal=\"true\">Return to the"
" ballot.</a> Not sure yet? <a href=\"/vote/faq\" data-internal=\"true\">Read"
" our frequently asked questions page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pare pou vote? <a href=\"/vote/ballot\" data-internal=\"true\">Retounen nan "
"bilten vòt la.</a> Ou poko sèten? <a href=\"/vote/faq\" data-"
"internal=\"true\">Li paj kesyon yo poze souvan nou an.</a>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:14
msgid ""
"We designed the Ideas in Action voting process to protect your privacy at "
"every step. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your "
"information when you take part in Boston's participatory budgeting vote."
msgstr ""
"Nou te kreye pwosesis vòt Ide an Aksyon an pou pwoteje vi prive w nan chak "
"etap. Règleman sa a eksplike kijan nou kolekte, itilize, epi pwoteje "
"enfòmasyon w yo lè w patisipe nan vòt bidjè patisipatif Boston an."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:15
msgid ""
"We use your votes only to determine which ballot proposals to fund in this "
"cycle."
msgstr ""
"Nou sèlman itilize vòt ou yo pou detèmine ki pwopozisyon bilten vòt pou "
"finanse nan sik sa a."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:16
msgid ""
"We will never link your email address to your ballot choices or your survey "
"responses."
msgstr ""
"Nou p&#39;ap janm lye adrès imel ou a ak chwa bilten vòt ou yo oswa repons "
"ou yo nan sondaj la."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:17
msgid ""
"When you register to vote, we ask for your mobile phone number. We use phone"
" numbers only to verify voter uniqueness and make sure each voter casts only"
" one ballot."
msgstr ""
"Lè w ap enskri pou vote, nou mande nimewo telefòn mobil ou. Nou itilize "
"nimewo telefòn sèlman pou verifye idantite votè a epi asire ke chak votè "
"depoze yon sèl bilten vòt."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:18
msgid ""
"Your ballot choices are completely anonymous. We never connect your votes to"
" your phone number, name, or identity."
msgstr ""
"Chwa bilten vòt ou yo konplètman anonim. Nou pa janm konekte vòt ou yo ak "
"nimewo telefòn ou, non ou, oswa idantite ou."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/privacy.html:19
msgid ""
"Your survey responses are anonymous and stored separately from your ballot. "
"We use this data only to understand how people connect with the Ideas in "
"Action process, and to make sure all Bostonians are represented. You can "
"skip any questions you do not want to answer."
msgstr ""
"Repons sondaj ou yo anonim epi yo estoke separeman ak bilten vòt ou a. Nou "
"itilize done sa yo sèlman pou konprann kijan moun konekte ak pwosesis Ide an"
" Aksyon an, epi pou asire ke tout Bostonyen yo reprezante. Ou ka sote nenpòt"
" kesyon ou pa vle reponn."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:7
msgid ""
"<img class=\"inline-scribble\" src=\"/static/img/iia/Scribble_Star_Pink.svg\">Thanks for voting!<img\n"
"                class=\"inline-scribble\" src=\"/static/img/iia/Scribble_Star_Pink.svg\">"
msgstr ""
"<img class=\"inline-scribble\" src=\"/static/img/iia/Scribble_Star_Pink.svg\">Mèsi paske ou te vote!<img\n"
"                class=\"inline-scribble\" src=\"/static/img/iia/Scribble_Star_Pink.svg\">"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:12
msgid ""
"Check all that apply. Some choices below may not be perfect for you, but please answer as best\n"
"                    you can. Use the write-in option to add more details or add another group you identify with."
msgstr ""
"Tcheke tout sa ki aplikab. Gen kèk chwa anba a ki ka pa pafè pou ou, men tanpri reponn pi byen ke posib.\n"
" Ou kapab. Sèvi ak opsyon ekriti a pou ajoute plis detay oubyen ajoute yon lòt gwoup ou idantifye avèk li."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:14
msgid ""
"Do you identify with any of the following in terms of your race\n"
"                    and/or ethnicity?"
msgstr ""
"Èske ou idantifye tèt ou ak nenpòt nan moun sa yo an tèm de ras ou\n"
" ak/oswa etnisite?"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:16
msgid ""
"Examples include: submitting ideas online, attending a workshop or forum, or voting for project\n"
"                    proposals on the ballot."
msgstr ""
"Men kèk egzanp: soumèt lide sou entènèt, patisipe nan yon atelye oswa yon fowòm, oswa vote pou yon pwojè.\n"
" pwopozisyon sou bilten vòt la."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:18
msgid ""
"Have you participated in Ideas in Action in the\n"
"                    past?"
msgstr ""
"Èske ou te patisipe nan Ide an Aksyon nan la\n"
" pase?"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:22
msgid ""
"If you are interested in receiving our newsletter with important PB\n"
"            updates, share your email address below. Your email address will not be connected with your vote or\n"
"            your answers to the questions above."
msgstr ""
"Si w enterese pou resevwa bilten nou an avèk enfòmasyon enpòtan sou PB\n"
" mizajou, pataje adrès imel ou anba a. Adrès imel ou a p ap gen rapò ak vòt ou a oswa\n"
" repons ou yo pou kesyon ki anwo yo."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:26
msgid ""
"Native Hawaiian or other Pacific\n"
"                            Islander"
msgstr ""
"Natif natal Awayen oswa lòt Pasifik\n"
" Moun zile"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:30
msgid "Optional Survey"
msgstr "Sondaj Opsyonèl"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:32
msgid ""
"Please answer a few short questions to help the City of Boston understand who is participating and how.\n"
"            Your responses to the questions below will be anonymous. <strong>You can skip any questions you do not want\n"
"                to answer.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Tanpri reponn kèk ti kesyon pou ede Vil Boston konprann ki moun k ap patisipe ak kijan.\n"
" Repons ou bay pou kesyon ki anba yo ap anonim. <strong>Ou ka sote nenpòt kesyon ou pa vle.\n"
" pou reponn.</strong>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:36
msgid "Race or ethnicity not listed here"
msgstr "Ras oswa etnisite ki pa nan lis isit la"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:37
msgid "Select an option"
msgstr "Chwazi yon opsyon"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:40
msgid "Thank you! Your survey has been submitted."
msgstr "Mèsi! Sondaj ou a te soumèt."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/survey.html:41
msgid "What is your age (in years)?"
msgstr "Ki laj ou (an ane)?"

