msgstr "Yo konte vòt ou a."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:1
msgid ""
"<strong>Carrier liability:</strong> Mobile carriers are not liable for "
"delayed or undelivered messages."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Responsablite operatè:</strong> Operatè mobil yo pa responsab pou "
"mesaj ki an reta oswa ki pa delivre."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:2
msgid ""
"<strong>Help instructions:</strong> If you need help, you can email us at "
"pb@boston.gov. <a href=\"mailto:pb@boston.gov\">Send us an email.</a>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Enstriksyon pou èd:</strong> Si ou bezwen èd, ou ka voye yon imèl ba"
" nou nan pb@boston.gov. <a href=\"mailto:pb@boston.gov\">Voye yon imèl ban "
"nou.</a>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:3
msgid ""
"<strong>Message frequency:</strong> You will get one text message with a "
"verification code each time you request one. We won't send you any more text"
" messages unless you ask for a new code."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Frekans mesaj:</strong> Ou ap resevwa yon mesaj tèks ak yon kòd "
"verifikasyon chak fwa ou mande youn. Nou p ap voye ba ou okenn lòt mesaj "
"tèks sof si ou mande yon nouvo kòd."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:4
msgid "<strong>Pricing:</strong> Message and data rates may apply."
msgstr "<strong>Pri:</strong> Ka gen frè pou mesaj ak done."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:5
msgid "<strong>Program name:</strong> Ideas in Action Voter Verification"
msgstr "<strong>Non pwogram nan:</strong> Ide an Aksyon Verifikasyon Votè"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:6
msgid "Contact us"
msgstr "Kontakte nou"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:7
msgid ""
"If you have any questions about these terms or the voting process, please "
"contact Boston's Office of Participatory Budgeting at pb@boston.gov. <a "
"href=\"mailto:pb@boston.gov\">Send us an email.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Si ou gen nenpòt kesyon sou tèm sa yo oswa sou pwosesis vòt la, tanpri "
"kontakte Biwo Bidjè Patisipatif Boston an nan pb@boston.gov. <a "
"href=\"mailto:pb@boston.gov\">Voye yon imèl ban nou.</a>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:8
msgid "Privacy and data handling"
msgstr "Konfidansyalite ak jesyon done"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:9
msgid ""
"Ready to vote? <a href=\"/vote/ballot\" data-internal=\"true\">Return to the"
" ballot.</a> Want to learn more? <a href=\"/vote/faq\" data-"
"internal=\"true\">Read our frequently asked questions page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pare pou vote? <a href=\"/vote/ballot\" data-internal=\"true\">Retounen nan "
"paj bilten vòt la.</a> Ou vle aprann plis? <a href=\"/vote/faq\" data-"
"internal=\"true\">Li paj kesyon yo poze souvan nou an.</a>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:10
#: src/sa_vote/templates/sa_vote/base.html:90
msgid "Terms of Service"
msgstr "Kondisyon Sèvis yo"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:11
msgid "Text message verification"
msgstr "Verifikasyon mesaj tèks"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:12
msgid ""
"These terms of service cover your use of the Ideas in Action voting platform"
" and the text message verification service."
msgstr ""
"Kondisyon sèvis sa yo kouvri itilizasyon ou fè de platfòm vòt Ideas in "
"Action ak sèvis verifikasyon mesaj tèks la."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:13
msgid ""
"To learn more about how we collect, use, and protect your information, "
"please read our privacy policy. <a href=\"/vote/privacy\" "
"target=\"_blank\">See our privacy policy.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pou aprann plis sou fason nou kolekte, itilize, epi pwoteje enfòmasyon ou "
"yo, tanpri li règleman sou enfòmasyon prive nou an. <a "
"href=\"/vote/privacy\" target=\"_blank\">Gade règleman sou enfòmasyon prive "
"nou an.</a>"

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:14
msgid ""
"We use phone numbers to make sure each person only votes once. By entering your phone number on our website, you agree to get a voter verification code\n"
"  by text message."
msgstr ""
"Nou itilize nimewo telefòn pou asire ke chak moun vote yon sèl fwa. Lè w antre nimewo telefòn ou sou sit entènèt nou an, ou dakò pou nou resevwa yon kòd verifikasyon votè.\n"
" pa mesaj tèks."

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:16
msgid ""
"Your privacy is extremely important to us. We will never store your phone "
"number in plain text. We will not share, sell, rent, or trade your phone "
"number or mobile messaging consent data with third parties or affiliates for"
" marketing or promotional purposes."
msgstr ""
"Konfidansyalite w trè enpòtan pou nou. Nou p ap janm sere nimewo telefòn ou "
"an tèks senp. Nou p ap pataje, vann, lwe, oswa echanje nimewo telefòn ou "
"oswa done konsantman mesaj mobil ou ak twazyèm pati oswa afilye pou rezon "
"maketing oswa pwomosyonèl."

